  "Buy Now": "Jetzt kaufen",
  "View Live Demo": "Live-Demo ansehen",
  "Efficient ": "Effizient ",
  " Inventory Tracking ": " Bestandsverfolgung ",
  " and Management": " und Management",
  "With the Consignment Module, businesses can efficiently track and manage consigned inventory within Dash SaaS. ": "Mit dem Konsignationsmodul können Unternehmen kommissionierten Lagerbestand innerhalb von Dash SaaS effizient verfolgen und verwalten. ",
  "Viewing and Pricing Products in Consignment": "Anzeigen und Bepreisen von Produkten in Konsignation",
  "The Commission Module allows users to view a comprehensive list of products in consignment, ensuring complete visibility over inventory. Additionally, users can manage and update the pricing of these consigned products, which is essential for accurate commission calculations. This feature ensures that all commission-related transactions reflect the most current product prices, maintaining transparency and precision in payouts. You can also add the tax in your consignment while pricing.": "Mit dem Kommissionsmodul können Benutzer eine umfassende Liste der in der Lieferung befindlichen Produkte anzeigen und so eine vollständige Übersicht über den Lagerbestand gewährleisten. ",
  "Creating and Converting Purchase Orders": "Bestellungen erstellen und umwandeln",
  "In the Commission Module, users can create detailed purchase orders and seamlessly convert these orders into actual purchases. This streamlined process ensures that procurement activities are efficiently managed and that all purchases are accurately recorded for commission calculations. By automating the conversion of purchase orders, the module reduces manual effort and enhances the accuracy of the procurement and commission tracking processes.": "Im Provisionsmodul können Benutzer detaillierte Bestellungen erstellen und diese Bestellungen nahtlos in tatsächliche Käufe umwandeln. ",
  "Creating and Converting Sale Orders": "Verkaufsaufträge erstellen und umwandeln",
  "The Commission Module also supports the creation of sale orders, which can be easily converted into finalized sales. This functionality is crucial for tracking sales performance and ensuring that commissions are calculated based on completed transactions. By automating the sale order conversion process, the module ensures timely and precise commission payouts, aligning sales": "Das Provisionsmodul unterstützt auch die Erstellung von Verkaufsaufträgen, die einfach in endgültige Verkäufe umgewandelt werden können. ",
